BUILDING

depends on raylib

    cd src
    cc -lm -lraylib -g main.c
    mkdir -p ~/.local/share/no-book
    mv src/overlay.nb ~/.local/share/no-book/overlay.nb




MENU FILE

A menu file is a save file that describes the appearence 
of the main menu. There is one provided at src/overlay.nb
however you can make your own with a simple save file:

    /*
     * To create a menu file, draw the strokes in
     * the following order. Anything drawn after
     * these has no special behavior and is just
     * for decoration.
     */
    
    enum Action {
        Action_UseBlack         = 0,
        Action_UseRed           = 1,
        Action_UseGreen         = 2,
        Action_UseYellow        = 3,
        Action_UseBlue          = 4,
        Action_UseMagenta       = 5,
        Action_UseCyan          = 6,
    
        Action_ExitMenu         = 7,
        Action_Save             = 8,
        Action_ChangeTheme      = 9,
    };



